  "weixin_html": "<section data-side-margin=\"0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#1f2937;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/xm1dT1jCe8lIO3P2oFVtd1x040PKGCRPN033gUTrHQQz0Licdqug5X1QgUPQBRCicoTqdYMrpgk7etibXLkK9rwcg/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" alt=\"关注提示\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 0 8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8f1 0%,#ffffff 100%);\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0 16px 20px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#f97316;letter-spacing:0.08em;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Daily Model Hub</p><h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:#111827;font-weight:800;\">每日精选HuggingFace热门模型</h1><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;\">2026-06-03 · Hugging Face 热门模型速览</p></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#1 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-03/01-nvidia-locateanything-3b.png\" alt=\"nvidia/LocateAnything-3B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">nvidia/LocateAnything-3B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LocateAnything-3B 是英伟达开发的视觉语言定位模型，专注于通过并行框解码技术实现快速且高质量的目标定位。该模型能够精准识别图像中的物体并生成边界框，适用于需要实时视觉推理、目标检测和跨模态交互的工业自动化或机器人视觉领域。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-03/02-liquidai-lfm2-5-8b-a1b.png\" alt=\"LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LFM2.5-8B-A1B 是 Liquid AI 推出的通用大语言模型，采用非传统的神经网络架构。该模型在保持高效计算性能的同时，兼顾了复杂文本理解与生成的准确性。其设计旨在提升模型在处理长序列任务时的能效比，适用于对计算资源受限但追求模型推理质量的各类应用场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-03/03-openbmb-minicpm5-1b.png\" alt=\"openbmb/MiniCPM5-1B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">openbmb/MiniCPM5-1B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">MiniCPM5-1B 是 OpenBMB 开发的轻量级多模态语言模型，拥有约 10 亿参数。该模型针对端侧设备进行了深度优化，具备出色的多模态理解能力。其体积小巧，不仅能够在手机等移动终端上高效运行，还适用于各种需要快速部署、低延迟响应的视觉问答及多模态交互任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-03/04-hauhaucs-qwen3-6-35b-a3b-uncensored-hauhaucs-aggressive.png\" alt=\"HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive 是基于 Qwen 模型架构构建的微调版本。该模型去除了预训练阶段的各种内容安全审查与限制，提供了更为直接的回复风格。它主要面向需要高度自由度、不受限制的文本生成实验，适用于特定的学术研究或不受审查约束的创意写作场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-03/05-stepfun-ai-step-3-7-flash.png\" alt=\"stepfun-ai/Step-3.7-Flash\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">stepfun-ai/Step-3.7-Flash</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Step-3.7-Flash 是阶跃星辰（Stepfun）推出的高性能轻量级大语言模型。该模型强调极致的推理速度与响应效率，旨在满足工业界对低延迟应用的需求。凭借高效的架构设计，它能够快速处理各类复杂对话与逻辑任务，适用于实时客服系统、即时语音助手以及其他对响应时延要求极高的生产环境。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\">